<title>USA: SeraCare wins $20 million contract.</title>
<headline>SeraCare wins $20 million contract.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>SeraCare Inc on Friday said it has won a three-year, $20 million contract to provide source plasma to blood products company, NABI Inc.</p>
<p>&quot;Becoming a plasma supplier to NABI will diversify our customer base considerably, and the increased revenues will facilitate our ongoing planned growth,&quot; Barry Plost, chief executive officer, said in a statement.</p>
</text>
